    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess i've talked to doctors and stuff, but they just want to talk about my meds or my blood pressure. it's not that. it's just... there's no point to it all. i'm just a burden to the kids, and i'm just watching the world move on without me. it's like i'm already gone, i'm just waiting for my body to realize it.",
